    <div class="fold-summary hidden-on-open">Nintendo Switch版の解放条件</div>
    <div class="fold-content visible-on-open"><div class="h-scrollable"><table><tbody><tr><th rowspan="4" style="text-align:center; color:white; width:140px;"><img src="https://cdn.wikiwiki.jp/to/w/arcaea/%E3%83%91%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF%E9%A0%86/::ref/Lock_white.png?rev=e752bf335d8d67b5c32cfe4d7580c221&amp;t=20210913183325" alt="Requirements" title="Requirements" width="25" height="33"  loading="lazy"><br class="spacer">Requirements</th><th style="color:white; text-align:center; width:80px;"><strong>共通</strong></th><td style="text-align:center; width:466px;"><a href="/arcaea/Nintendo%20Switch/%E3%83%AF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%89%E3%83%A2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89/Chapter%203#luminous" title="Nintendo Switch/ワールドモード/Chapter 3" class="rel-wiki-page">ワールドモード (Chapter 3)</a> で解禁</td></tr><tr><th style="color:aqua; text-align:center; width:80px;"><strong>Past</strong></th><td style="text-align:center; width:466px;">10個の欠片<br class="spacer"><a href="/arcaea/%E4%B9%9D%E7%95%AA%E7%9B%AE%E3%81%AE%E8%BF%B7%E8%B7%AF" title="九番目の迷路" class="rel-wiki-page">九番目の迷路</a> [<span class="wikicolor" style="color:aqua"><strong>PST</strong></span>] のプレイ<br class="spacer"><a href="/arcaea/The%20Message" title="The Message" class="rel-wiki-page">The Message</a> [<span class="wikicolor" style="color:aqua"><strong>PST</strong></span>] のプレイ<br class="spacer"><a href="/arcaea/Sulfur" title="Sulfur" class="rel-wiki-page">Sulfur</a> [<span class="wikicolor" style="color:aqua"><strong>PST</strong></span>] のプレイ</td></tr><tr><th style="color:lime; text-align:center; width:80px;"><strong>Present</strong></th><td style="text-align:center; width:466px;">20個の欠片<br class="spacer"><a href="/arcaea/%E4%B9%9D%E7%95%AA%E7%9B%AE%E3%81%AE%E8%BF%B7%E8%B7%AF" title="九番目の迷路" class="rel-wiki-page">九番目の迷路</a> [<span class="wikicolor" style="color:lime"><strong>PRS</strong></span>] のプレイ<br class="spacer"><a href="/arcaea/The%20Message" title="The Message" class="rel-wiki-page">The Message</a> [<span class="wikicolor" style="color:lime"><strong>PRS</strong></span>] のプレイ<br class="spacer"><a href="/arcaea/Sulfur" title="Sulfur" class="rel-wiki-page">Sulfur</a> [<span class="wikicolor" style="color:lime"><strong>PRS</strong></span>] のプレイ</td></tr><tr><th style="color:fuchsia; text-align:center; width:80px;"><strong>Future</strong></th><td style="text-align:center; width:466px;">30個の欠片<br class="spacer"><a href="/arcaea/%E4%B9%9D%E7%95%AA%E7%9B%AE%E3%81%AE%E8%BF%B7%E8%B7%AF" title="九番目の迷路" class="rel-wiki-page">九番目の迷路</a> [<span class="wikicolor" style="color:fuchsia"><strong>FTR</strong></span>] のクリア グレード「AA」以上<br class="spacer"><a href="/arcaea/The%20Message" title="The Message" class="rel-wiki-page">The Message</a> [<span class="wikicolor" style="color:fuchsia"><strong>FTR</strong></span>] のクリア グレード「AA」以上<br class="spacer"><a href="/arcaea/Sulfur" title="Sulfur" class="rel-wiki-page">Sulfur</a> [<span class="wikicolor" style="color:fuchsia"><strong>FTR</strong></span>] のクリア グレード「AA」以上</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</div>
</div>
